{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫電視（TVB）真人騷《中年好聲音4》今晚（8月23日）晚上7時30分於翡翠台現場直播總決賽《中年好聲音4登峯之戰》，終極7強名單包括：鄭家聲、蔡宓婕、尹景順、吳亦偉、許雲妮、尤淑情及許美琪。</p><p>以下立即為大家帶來即時戰況！</p><p>鄭家聲《海闊天空》90分</p><figure><img alt=\"鄭家聲奪得90分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168289234105143296587962.jpeg/453J-B5J6qnyzN5I1Z4zOe2tzAyRPTvaS0Z81UtGfNU\"/><figcaption>鄭家聲奪得90分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>蔡宓婕《美麗之最》91分</p><figure><img alt=\"蔡宓婕奪得91分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168289287775457280712983.jpeg/Cg5jcZyGS3ewYGKWkpyWRVHi5szdqWAsuq1UmLqtVJg\"/><figcaption>蔡宓婕奪得91分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>尹景順《百年孤寂》94分</p><figure><img alt=\"尹景順好驚喜。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168291536451014656187064.jpeg/RpbAsNdDrmVSFCXjXUXGtPVEfZ8yTj_JOfWo8jn1qPI\"/><figcaption>尹景順好驚喜。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"尹景順奪得94分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168291534060130304356498.jpeg/iZ2RgsWZ3ef-2bFQvZ0ebr6UNO8UED_DAjbS3QI20t0\"/><figcaption>尹景順奪得94分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>吳亦偉《酷愛》92分</p><figure><img alt=\"吳亦偉奪得92分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168292945489563648238704.jpeg/aRQR9wG2nkd8R-DSjE5OZKWtt7zDhH_goQJJMaECSTE\"/><figcaption>吳亦偉奪得92分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>許雲妮《我等到花兒也謝了》93分</p><figure><img alt=\"許雲妮奪得93分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168295626740338688189470.jpeg/qbo4lPkaipKhieMcQpGn-75c5f-6TSMPYtrz6WLa8-k\"/><figcaption>許雲妮奪得93分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>尤淑情《我期待》91分</p><figure><img alt=\"尤淑情奪得91分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168297540840329216029176.jpeg/aoJYVCrEUmBvYx0OFXxidAQxVoI_jIEbhzXmyYc15sk\"/><figcaption>尤淑情奪得91分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>許美琪《（你沒有）好結果》90分</p><figure><img alt=\"許美琪喊晒口。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168300541344747520431860.jpeg/IalhR_qAFq69I7NnSK3E6g02HHxCBByA7jI2Ce4yNgk\"/><figcaption>許美琪喊晒口。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"許美琪奪得90分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168300238151094272037158.jpeg/u1pqf8dktcJn1ZPTeLjT2qGVOXgdz5BrGDsJmhg7CZo\"/><figcaption>許美琪奪得90分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>慢歌環節結束，鄭家聲與許美琪暫時得90分墊底，而大熱尹景順則有94分，立即進入快歌環節，這個環節公布分數只會公布一位評審的分數。</p><p>鄭家聲《鐵幕誘惑》在海兒手上奪得93分。</p><figure><img alt=\"鄭家聲在海兒手上奪得93分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168302087168069632490281.jpeg/jy96Xp04parr_sQpY9MPKGXdqoPfGH2zo1PnIqNT5yI\"/><figcaption>鄭家聲在海兒手上奪得93分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>蔡宓婕《真情人》在肥媽手上奪95分，張佳添畀92分。</p><figure><img alt=\"同男舞者跳貼身辣舞。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168302929317466112415802.jpeg/XisBIqOWNCBH5zAicEWTA5IQ2oC2rm6-NHjhbTR44W0\"/><figcaption>同男舞者跳貼身辣舞。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同男舞者跳貼身辣舞。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168302927060799488568324.jpeg/QBQb_mh3WCPQXHlUn4g3-VV9IucWKpLHEUIBnRFCAZ0\"/><figcaption>同男舞者跳貼身辣舞。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"同男舞者跳貼身辣舞。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168302924514725888596472.jpeg/wsFY2HLs3qrdwGLxems7nQvKHRfpFrq_P03gxT9N4MU\"/><figcaption>同男舞者跳貼身辣舞。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"蔡宓婕在肥媽手上奪95分，張佳添畀92分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168303576263430144274395.jpeg/fW1brKcr4ISLil0E8Po6D7htjFphzitNWH7kJFh-5CQ\"/><figcaption>蔡宓婕在肥媽手上奪95分，張佳添畀92分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>尹景順《大熱》巫啟賢同李克勤都畀94高分。</p><figure><img alt=\"尹景順獲巫啟賢同李克勤畀94高分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168304642963017728456809.jpeg/qF3CVPfr0AlOaeK_rrDyDkLbhPx0Yi2_MVt3EDFbdxA\"/><figcaption>尹景順獲巫啟賢同李克勤畀94高分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>吳亦偉《皮囊》獲得肥媽96分、李克勤92分。</p><figure><img alt=\"吳亦偉《皮囊》獲得肥媽96分、李克勤92分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168306710029275136801245.jpeg/2EhIreDC-dUV75dqxjAzyXl_gvC-IjoncrqLGHK6ixg\"/><figcaption>吳亦偉《皮囊》獲得肥媽96分、李克勤92分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>許雲妮《I Will Survive》獲得巫啟賢94分、周國豐92分。</p><figure><img alt=\"許雲妮《I Will Survive》獲得巫啟賢94分、周國豐92分。（節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168308516608282624971523.jpeg/xnRjLPTc3iSis8bKEVvBHZghh4zIJQ_cvWCwMb1gsDE\"/><figcaption>許雲妮《I Will Survive》獲得巫啟賢94分、周國豐92分。（節目截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T13:33:57.000464+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":737,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}